# Perfect-block parity: the attacker's copy of a guarding teammate opens its perfect-block window when the teammate has
# the talent (the talents cross, and RemotePlayer holds the window by the vitals flag besides). Without it the copy
# blocks plainly and the attacker sees an ordinary block where the defender made a perfect one. Hero 5 slot 0, over the
# delayed link of combat.coop.

include session_net.coop
A expect teammate contains "dist=" timeout=30
B expect equip weapon_sword_longsword contains "equipped" timeout=6
B expect equip weapon_shield_roundShield contains "equipped" timeout=6
include ff_place.part
B stance combat
sleep 2

# No talent: the copy's window stays shut.
B press secondaryattack 2
sleep 3
A expect counter perfectwindow == 0 timeout=1

# The talent the game itself asks for.
capture perfect B talent perfect
B talent learn $perfect
sleep 2
B press secondaryattack 2
sleep 3
B press secondaryattack 2
A expect counter perfectwindow >= 1 timeout=6
A shot
B shot
